span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -36.1pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 36.1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">대학원생 또는 휴학, 자퇴 등 학업활동 중단자(현재 군복무자 포함) </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -36.1pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 36.1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - <font color=\"#ff007f\">학기초과자</font></span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;-<font color=\"#ff007f\"> 기등록자</font></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#ff007f\">*<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">는 국가장학금 지원 불가</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.2pt\">&nbsp;</span></font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;(<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#ff007f\">*</font></span>기존</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 국가장학금 수혜자가 등록금 납부 후 휴학하여, 당해학기 복학 예정인 자)<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.2pt\"> </span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><br><strong></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2. 신청기간 : </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2012. 12. 13(목) ~ 2013. 1. 11(금) 18:00까지 일요일, 공휴일 24시간 신청가능</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; [서류접수마감 : 2013. 1. 18(금)까지]</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br><strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">※ 반드시 본인 명의 공인인증서를 미리 발급받아야 신청 가능합니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br><strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">3. 신청방법 : </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">붙임자료 내용중 \"<font color=\"#0900ff\">국가장학금 신청절차</font>\" 참고</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br><strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">4. 한국장학재단 홈페이지 : </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><a href=\"http://www.kosaf.go.kr/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #800080\"><u>www.kosaf.go.kr</u></span></a></span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><u><strong></strong></u></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">상담센터 : 1599-2000(평일 09:00~18:00까지)</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-